rry Concentrate, Organic Lemon Juice, Organic Dragon Fruit Flavor, Organic Fruit Punch Flavor, Sea Salt, Natural Flavor from Non-GMO Plants, Purple Carrot, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla Fruit, Organic Maqui Berries, Organic Manuka Honey, Organic Ginseng, Organic Maca. <strong>Contains: Coconut.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mango</strong>: Filtered Water, Organic Agave, Organic Coconut Water, Organic Mango Flavor, Organic Lemon Juice, Natural Mango Flavor, Sea Salt, Natural Flavor from Non-GMO Plants, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla Fruit, Organic Maqui Berries, Organic Manuka Honey, Organic Ginseng, Organic Maca. <strong>Contains: Coconut.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tropical Punch</strong>: Filtered Water, Organic Agave, Organic Coconut Water, Organic Lemon Juice Concentrate, Organic Coconut Water Flavor, Organic Pineapple Flavor, Organic Mango Flavor, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla Fruit, Sea Salt, Natural Flavor from Non-GMO Plants, Organic Maqui Berries, Organic Manuka Honey, Organic Ginseng, Organic Maca. <strong>Contains: Coconut.</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2227/4617/files/Berri_Fit_Nutrition_Facts_480x480.png?v=1708980037\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
